sequenceDiagram
    participant SP as Salesperson
    participant CRM as Webinar CRM
    participant C as Calon Client
    participant N as Notification Channel

    SP->>CRM: Create and publish session
    CRM-->>SP: Public booking URL
    SP-->>C: Share booking URL
    C->>CRM: Choose session and submit booking
    CRM->>CRM: Atomic capacity and duplicate check
    CRM-->>C: Registration confirmed
    CRM->>N: Queue confirmation and reminders
    N-->>C: Send schedule and meeting link
    SP->>CRM: Record or import attendance
    CRM-->>SP: Attended/no-show list
    SP->>CRM: Complete follow-up task

